<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Osée</para>
  <para style="toc1">OSÉE</para>
  <para style="toc2">Osée</para>
  <para style="toc3">Os</para>
  <para style="mt1">OSÉE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HOS 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 1:1"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a ki te vini a Osée, fis a Béeri a, pandan jou Ozias yo, Jotham, Achaz, ak Ézéchias, wa a Juda a, e nan tan Jéroboam, fis a Joas la, wa Israël la.<verse eid="HOS 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 1:2"/>Lè SENYÈ a te pale an premye pa Osée, SENYÈ a te di a Osée: “Ale, pran pou ou menm, yon madanm pwostitiye, ak pitit enfidèl yo. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:16">Det 31:16</ref> </char></note>peyi a ap komèt gwo pwostitisyon. L ap abandone SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="HOS 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 1:3"/>Konsa, li te ale pran Gomer, fi a Diblaïm nan. Li te vin ansent, e li te fè yon fis pou li.<verse eid="HOS 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 1:4"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te di li: “Bay li non <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:22">Os 2:22</ref></char></note>Jizreel; paske deja nan yon ti tan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:11">II Wa 10:11</ref> </char></note>mwen va vanje san a Jizreel sou lakay Jéhu. Epi sa va koze wayòm lakay Israël la fini. <verse eid="HOS 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 1:5"/>Nan jou sa a, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:35">Jr 49:35</ref> </char></note>kraze banza Israël la nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 17:16">Jos 17:16</ref></char></note>vale Jizreel la.”<verse eid="HOS 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 1:6"/>Konsa, li te vin ansent ankò, e li te bay nesans a yon fi. Epi SENYÈ a te di li: “Rele li Lo Ruchama, paske Mwen p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:4">Os 2:4</ref> </char></note>fè konpasyon ankò pou lakay Israël, pou M ta janm padone yo. <verse eid="HOS 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 1:7"/>Men Mwen va genyen konpasyon pou lakay Juda. Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:5">Jr 25:5</ref>,<ref loc="JER 25:6">6</ref></char></note>delivre pa SENYÈ Bondye yo, a e yo p ap delivre ni pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:3-7">Sòm 44:3-7</ref> </char></note>banza, ni pa nepe, ni pa batay, pa cheval, ni chevalye.”<verse eid="HOS 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 1:8"/>Alò, lè li te fin sevre Lo Ruchama, li te vin ansent, e li te fè yon fis.<verse eid="HOS 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 1:9"/>Epi SENYÈ a te di: “Rele li Lo Ammi, paske nou pa pèp Mwen, ni Mwen pa Bondye nou.” <verse eid="HOS 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 1:10"/>Malgre sa, fis Israël yo va tankou sab lanmè, ki p ap ka mezire, ni konte. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:26">Wo 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:1">És 65:1</ref> </char></note>nan plas kote sa te pale a yo menm nan, ‘Nou pa pèp Mwen an’, sa va pale a yo menm ‘Yo va rele fis a Bondye vivan an.’ <verse eid="HOS 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 1:11"/>Konsa, fis a Juda ak fis Israël yo va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:5">Jr 23:5</ref>,<ref loc="JER 23:6">6</ref></char></note>rasanble ansanm, epi yo va chwazi pou kont yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:21">Jr 30:21</ref> </char></note>yon sèl chèf, epi yo va monte depi nan peye a, paske jou a Jizreel la va vreman gran.<verse eid="HOS 1:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HOS 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 2:1"/>“Di a frè ou a ‘Pèp mwen yo’!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:1">Epi a sè ou yo, ‘Byen ame mwen an!’<verse eid="HOS 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 2:2"/>Rebike manman ou!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:2">Rebike, paske li pa madanm mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:2">ni mwen pa mari li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:2">Kite li retire pwostitisyon li yo devan figi li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:2">ak adiltè li yo soti antre tete li yo;<verse eid="HOS 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 2:3"/>sinon M ta chire retire tout rad li pou fè l parèt</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:3">toutouni menm jan ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:4">Éz 16:4</ref></char></note>jou li te fèt la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:3">pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 32:13">És 32:13</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 32:14">14</ref></char></note> fè l vin tankou yon peyi dezè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:3">e touye li ak swaf.<verse eid="HOS 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 2:4"/>Anplis, Mwen p ap fè mizerikòd sou pitit li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:4">akoz yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:14">Jr 13:14</ref> </char></note>pitit a pwostitiye.<verse eid="HOS 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 2:5"/>Paske manman yo te fè pwostitisyon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:5">Li ki te fè yo aji san wont, paske li te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:5">‘Mwen va swiv moun ki renmen mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:5">ki ban m pen ak dlo mwen, lenn ak len mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:5">lwil ak bwason mwen.’<verse eid="HOS 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 2:6"/>Akoz sa, Mwen va fè monte yon kloti pikan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:6">e Mwen va bati yon mi kont li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:6">pou l pa ka twouve ti wout li yo.<verse eid="HOS 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 2:7"/>Li va kouri dèyè moun ki renmen li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:7">men li p ap ka rive sou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:7">Li va chache yo, men li p ap jwenn yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:7">Konsa li va di: ‘M ap prale retounen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:7">kote premye mari Mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:7">paske lè sa a te pi bon pou mwen pase koulye a.’<verse eid="HOS 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 2:8"/>Paske li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:3">És 1:3</ref> </char></note>pa t konnen ke se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:19">Éz 16:19</ref></char></note>Mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:8">ki te bay li sereyal la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:8">diven nèf ak lwil la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:8">e ki te bay li anpil lò ak ajan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:8">ke yo te fè sèvi pou Baal yo.<verse eid="HOS 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 2:9"/>Akoz sa, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 8:7">Os 8:7</ref></char></note>reprann</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:9">sereyal Mwen an nan lè rekòlt la</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:9">ak diven Mwen an nan sezon li an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:9">Mwen va, anplis, retire lenn Mwen an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:9">ak len Ki te pou kouvri pou li pa t toutouni an.<verse eid="HOS 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 2:10"/>Konsa, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:37">Éz 16:37</ref></char></note>dekouvri wont li devan zye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:10">a tout moun ki renmen li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:10">e pèsòn p ap mande fè l soti nan men Mwen.<verse eid="HOS 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 2:11"/>Anplis, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:34">Jr 7:34</ref> </char></note>mete fen a tout kè kontan l;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:11">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 3:4">Os 3:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>fèt li yo, nouvèl lin li yo, Saba a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:11">ak tout Gwo rasanbleman fèt li yo.<verse eid="HOS 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 2:12"/>Mwen va detwi pye rezen li yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:12">ansanm ak pye fig fwi etranje yo selon sila li te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:12">‘Sa yo se salè mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:12">ke moun ki renmen m yo te ban mwen.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:12">Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:5">És 5:5</ref></char></note>fè yo tounen yon rakbwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:12">e bèt chan va devore yo.<verse eid="HOS 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 2:13"/>Mwen va pini li pou jou Baal yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:13">kote li te brile lasan nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:13">lè l te abiye tèt li ak zanno ak bijou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:13">pou l swiv moun ki renmen li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:13">epi te<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:6">Os 4:6</ref> </char></note>bliye Mwen” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="HOS 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 2:14"/>Pou sa, gade byen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:14">Mwen va atire li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:33-38">Éz 20:33-38</ref> </char></note>mennen li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:14">antre nan dezè a pou pale dous avèk li.<verse eid="HOS 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 2:15"/>Epi soti la, Mwen va bay li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:26">Jos 7:26</ref></char></note>chan rezen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:15">ak Vale Akò a kon yon pòt espwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:15">Li va reponn la tankou nan jou jenès li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:15">tankou nan jou lè l te vin monte</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:15">soti nan peyi Égypte la.<verse eid="HOS 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 2:16"/>Li va vin rive nan jou sa a”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:16">deklare SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:16">“ke ou va rele Mwen: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:5">És 54:5</ref></char></note> ‘Mari mwen’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:16">e ou p ap rele M ankò: ‘Met mwen’.<verse eid="HOS 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 2:17"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:13">Egz 23:13</ref></char></note>Mwen va retire non a Baal yo soti nan bouch li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:17">pou yo pa nonmen pa non yo ankò.<verse eid="HOS 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 2:18"/>Nan jou sa a, anplis, Mwen va fè yon Akò</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:18">pou yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:23">Job 5:23</ref> </char></note>bèt chan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:18">zwazo syèl yo ak sa ki trennen atè yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:18">Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:4">És 2:4</ref></char></note>aboli banza, nepe ak lagè soti nant peyi a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:18">e Mwen va fè yo kouche dòmi ansekirite.<verse eid="HOS 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 2:19"/>Mwen va fè ou vin renmen M jis pou tout tan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:19">Wi, Mwen va fè ou vin renmen M nan ladwati ak lajistis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:19">nan lanmou dous ak konpasyon.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:27">És 1:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HOS 2:20"/>Epi Mwen va fè ou renmen M nan fidelite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:20">Nan lè sa a, ou va konnen SENYÈ a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:33">Jr 31:33</ref>,<ref loc="JER 31:34">34</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HOS 2:21"/>“Li va vin rive nan jou sa a ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:10">És 55:10</ref></char></note> Mwen va reponn”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:21">deklare SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:21">“Mwen va reponn a syèl yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:21">e yo va reponn a tè a.<verse eid="HOS 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HOS 2:22"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:12">Jr 31:12</ref></char></note>Latè va reponn a sereyal la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:22">diven nèf ak lwil la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:22">epi yo va reponn a Jizreel.<verse eid="HOS 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HOS 2:23"/>Mwen va simen li kote M nan tè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:23">Mwen va genyen mizerikòd pou li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:23">fi ki pa t konn jwenn mizerikòd la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:23">Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:25">Wo 9:25</ref></char></note>Mwen va di a sila ki pa t pèp Mwen an:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:23">‘Ou se pèp Mwen an!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:23">Epi yo va reponn: ‘Ou se Bondye mwen!’”<verse eid="HOS 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HOS 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 3:1"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te di mwen: “Ale ankò, renmen ak yon fanm ki renmen pa yon lòt, malgre se yon fanm adiltè, menm jan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:20">Jr 3:20</ref> </char></note>ke SENYÈ a renmen fis Israël yo, poutan, yo vire vè lòt dye yo, e yo renmen gato rezen yo.”<verse eid="HOS 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 3:2"/>Konsa, mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:10">Rt 4:10</ref> </char></note>achte fanm nan pou yon sòm a kenz pyès ajan ak yon omè edmi lòj. <verse eid="HOS 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 3:3"/>Mwen te di li: “Ou va rete avè m pandan anpil jou. Ou p ap fè pwostitisyon, ni ou p ap madanm a yon gason. Epi konsa, mwen va menm jan anvè ou menm.” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:13">Det 21:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 3:4"/>Paske, fis Israël yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:3">Os 10:3</ref></char></note>rete pandan anpil jou san wa ni prens, san <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref> </char></note>sakrifis, ni pilye sakre, san efòd e san zidòl lakay yo. <verse eid="HOS 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 3:5"/>Apre sa, fis Israël yo va retounen chache SENYÈ Bondye yo a, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:9">Jr 30:9</ref> </char></note>David, wa yo a. Yo va vini avèk krentif kote SENYÈ a e kote bonte Li nan dènye jou yo.<verse eid="HOS 3:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HOS 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 4:1"/>Koute pawòl SENYÈ a, O fis a Israël yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:1">paske SENYÈ a gen yon pwose kont pèp peyi a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:1">Anverite, nanpwen fidelite, ni dousè, ni konesans Bondye nan peyi a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:2">Os 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:4">És 59:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 4:2"/>Gen joure ak madichon, vyole konfyans,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:2">asasine moun, vòlè, fè adiltè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:2">Yo aji ak vyolans jiskaske yo vèse san,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:2">e vèse san fè san vèse plis.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Jen 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Det 5:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 4:3"/>Akoz sa, peyi a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 24:4">És 24:4</ref> </char></note>fè dèy.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:3">Tout moun ki rete ladann ap megri</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:3">menm ak tout sa ki viv.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:3">Menm bèt chan yo ak zwazo syèl yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:3">epi pwason lanmè yo va mouri.<verse eid="HOS 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 4:4"/>Malgre sa, pa kite okenn moun pote akizasyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:4">ni okenn moun vin repwoche;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:4">paske pèp nou an se tankou sila</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:4">ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 14:3">Det 14:3</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 14:7">7</ref> </char></note>fè kont ak prèt yo.<verse eid="HOS 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 4:5"/>Konsa, nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:3">Éz 14:3</ref></char></note>glise tonbe nan lajounen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:5">e menm pwofèt la va glise tonbe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:5">avèk nou nan lannwit.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:5">Epi Mwen va detwi manman ou.<verse eid="HOS 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 4:6"/>Pèp Mwen an detwi akoz mank konesans.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:6">Akoz ou te rejte konesans,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:6">Mwen menm tou, Mwen va rejte ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:6">Ou p ap ka fè prèt pou Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:6">akoz ou te bliye lalwa Bondye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:6">Konsa, Mwen menm tou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:6">Mwen ap bliye pitit nou yo.<verse eid="HOS 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 4:7"/>Plis ke yo te miltipliye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:7">plis ke yo te peche kont mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:7">Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:16">Hab 2:16</ref> </char></note>fè glwa yo vin chanje an wont.<verse eid="HOS 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 4:8"/>Yo manje sou peche a pèp Mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:8">e yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:11">És 56:11</ref> </char></note>dirije volonte yo vè inikite yo.<verse eid="HOS 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 4:9"/>Se konsa sa va ye: jan pèp la ye a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:9">se konsa prèt la ye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:9">Akoz sa, Mwen va pini yo pou chemen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:9">e Mwen va rekonpanse yo pou zak yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 8:13">Os 8:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 4:10"/>Yo va manje, men yo p ap gen ase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:10">Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 7:4">Os 7:4</ref> </char></note>fè pwostitisyon, men yo p ap ogmante,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:10">akoz yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:1">Os 9:1</ref> </char></note>sispann koute SENYÈ a.<verse eid="HOS 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 4:11"/>Lavi pwostitisyon, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 20:1">Pwov 20:1</ref></char></note>diven,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:11">ak diven nèf retire bon konprann.<verse eid="HOS 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 4:12"/>Pèp mwen an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:19">És 44:19</ref></char></note> mande konsèy</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:12">a zidòl ki fèt ak bwa yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:12">Paske yon lespri pwostitisyon te egare yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:12">yo te enfidèl a Bondye yo a.<verse eid="HOS 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 4:13"/>Yo ofri sakrifis sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:6">Jr 3:6</ref> </char></note>tèt mòn yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:13">e yo brile lansan sou kolin yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:13">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:29">És 1:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Anba pye bwadchèn yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:13">pye sikrèn ak pye mapou yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:13">akoz lonbraj yo dous.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:13">Akoz sa, fi nou yo fè pwostitisyon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:13">e madanm nou yo fè adiltè.<verse eid="HOS 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 4:14"/>Mwen p ap pini fi nou yo lè yo fè pwostitisyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:14">ni madanm nou yo lè yo fè adiltè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:14">Paske, mesye yo, yo menm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:14">ale sou kote ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:17">Det 23:17</ref></char></note>pwostitiye yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:14">e fè sakrifis yo ak pwostitiye tanp yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:14">Konsa, pèp san konprann nan vin detwi nèt.<verse eid="HOS 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 4:15"/>Malgre sa, ou menm, Israël, ou fè pwostitisyon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:15">men ou pa kite Juda vin koupab;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:15">pa monte vè Guilgal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:15">ni monte nan Beth-Aven,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:15">ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:2">Jr 5:2</ref> </char></note>sèmante: “Jan Bondye vivan an!”<verse eid="HOS 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 4:16"/>Paske Israël fè tèt li di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:16">tankou yon gazèl ak tèt rèd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:16">Èske SENYÈ a, koulye a, kapab nouri yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:16">tankou jenn mouton nan yon bèl chan?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:17">És 5:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 4:17"/>Éphraïm vin jwenn ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:2">Os 13:2</ref></char></note>zidòl yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:17">Kite li pou kont li.<verse eid="HOS 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 4:18"/>Bwason yo vin gen gou si.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:18">Yo jwe pwostitiye tout tan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:18">Chèf yo vrèman renmen wont yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 3:11">Mi 3:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 4:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 12:1">Os 12:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Van an te vlope li nan zèl li yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:19">yo va wont akoz sakrifis yo fè.<verse eid="HOS 4:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HOS 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 5:1"/>Tande bagay sa a, O prèt yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:1">Prete zòrèy ou O lakay Israël!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:1">Koute byen, O lakay wa a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:1">Paske jijman an se pou ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:1">paske ou te yon pèlen nan Mitspa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:1">e yon Filè ouvri sou Thabor.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:8">Os 9:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 5:2"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 9:15">Os 9:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rebèl yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:15">És 29:15</ref></char></note>desann fon nan fè masak;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:2">men Mwen va fè chatiman rive sou Yo tout.<verse eid="HOS 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 5:3"/>Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 3:2">Am 3:2</ref></char></note>konnen Éphraïm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:3">e Israël pa kache devan M;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:3">paske koulye a, O Éphraïm, ou te jwe pwostitiye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:3">Israël te souye tèt li.<verse eid="HOS 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 5:4"/>Zak yo p ap pèmèt ke yo retounen jwenn Bondye yo a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:4">paske, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:12">Os 4:12</ref></char></note>lespri pwostitisyon rete anndan yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:4">Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:6">Os 4:6</ref>,<ref loc="HOS 4:14">14</ref> </char></note>pa konnen SENYÈ a.<verse eid="HOS 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 5:5"/>Anplis, ògèy Israël la temwaye kont li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:5">Donk, Israël ak Éphraïm va tonbe nan inikite yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:5">Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:31-35">Éz 23:31-35</ref> </char></note>Juda va tonbe avèk yo.<verse eid="HOS 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 5:6"/>Yo va ale avèk bann mouton ak twoupo yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:6">pou y al chache SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:6">men yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:28">Pwov 1:28</ref></char></note>p ap jwenn Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:6">Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:6">Éz 8:6</ref> </char></note>retire tèt Li kite yo.<verse eid="HOS 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 5:7"/>Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:8">És 48:8</ref></char></note>aji an trèt kont SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:7">paske yo te fè pitit ilejitim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:7">Koulye a nouvèl lin nan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:7">va devore yo menm ak chan yo.<verse eid="HOS 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 5:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:1">Jl 2:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Soufle kòn Guibea a, twonpèt Rama a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:8">Sone alam Beth-Aven nan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:8">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 5:14">Jij 5:14</ref> </char>
    </note>Dèyè ou, Benjamin!<verse eid="HOS 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 5:9"/>Éphraïm va vin yon kote dezole nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:3">És 37:3</ref></char></note>jou repwòch la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:9">Pami tribi Israël yo, Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 46:10">És 46:10</ref></char></note>deklare sa ki va rive.<verse eid="HOS 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 5:10"/>Prens a Juda yo te vin tankou sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:14">Det 19:14</ref></char></note>deplase Bòn yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:10">Sou yo, Mwen va vide tout</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:10">chalè kòlè Mwen an tankou dlo.<verse eid="HOS 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 5:11"/>Éphraïm vin oprime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:11">Li vin kraze nan jijman an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:11">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 6:16">Mi 6:16</ref> </char>
    </note>akoz li te pran desizyon pou swiv zidòl yo.<verse eid="HOS 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 5:12"/>Akoz sa, mwen vin tankou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:12">yon papiyon twal pou Éphraïm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:12">e tankou pouriti pou lakay Juda.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 39:11">Sòm 39:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 5:13"/>“Lè Éphraïm te wè maladi li a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:13">e Juda, jan li te blese a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:13">alò, Éphraïm te ale kote Assyrie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:13">Li te voye kote Wa Jareb.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:13">Men li p ap ka geri w,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:13">ni li p ap ka fè geri maleng ou an.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 7:11">Os 7:11</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 10:6">Os 10:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 5:14"/>Paske, Mwen va tankou yon lyon pou Éphraïm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:14">e Mwen va tankou yon jenn lyon pou lakay Juda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:14">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 50:22">Sòm 50:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mwen menm, Mwen va chire an mòso</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:14">e Mwen va ale.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:14">Mwen va pote ale, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:8">Mi 5:8</ref> </char></note>p ap gen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:14">moun ki pou delivre.<verse eid="HOS 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 5:15"/>Mwen va ale retounen nan plas Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:15">jiskaske yo vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 64:7">És 64:7</ref></char></note>rekonèt koupabilite yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:15">pou chache fas Mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:15">Nan soufrans yo, y ap vin chache Mwen ak tout kè.”<verse eid="HOS 5:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HOS 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 6:1"/>Vini, annou retounen kote SENYÈ a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:1">paske li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:39">Det 32:39</ref> </char></note>chire nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:1">men Li va geri nou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:1">Li te blese nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:1">men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:17">Jr 30:17</ref></char></note>Li va panse nou.<verse eid="HOS 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 6:2"/>Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 30:5">Sòm 30:5</ref> </char></note>fè nou vin refè apre de jou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:2">Nan twazyèm jou a Li va fè nou leve.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:2">Konsa, nou va viv devan Li.<verse eid="HOS 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 6:3"/>Annou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:3">És 2:3</ref> </char></note>rekonèt SENYÈ a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:3">annou refize lage pou nou ka konnen SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:3">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 19:6">Sòm 19:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Aparans Li asire tankou solèy</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:3">k ap leve granmmaten.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:3">Konsa, Li va vini sou nou tankou lapli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:3">tankou lapli prentan k ap wouze latè.<verse eid="HOS 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 6:4"/>Kisa pou M fè ak ou, O Éphraïm?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:4">Kisa pou M fè ak ou, O Juda?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:4">Paske fidelite ou tankou nwaj nan maten,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:4">tankou farinay ki disparèt bonè.<verse eid="HOS 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 6:5"/>Akoz sa, Mwen te taye yo an mòso ak pwofèt yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:5">Mwen te touye yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:29">Jr 23:29</ref></char></note>pawòl bouch Mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:5">Jijman Ou yo se tankou loray k ap tire.<verse eid="HOS 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 6:6"/>Paske, Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:13">Mat 9:13</ref> </char></note> pito mizerikòd <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:11">És 1:11</ref></char></note> olye sakrifis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:6">epi konesans Bondye a plis ke ofrann brile.<verse eid="HOS 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 6:7"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:33">Job 31:33</ref> </char></note> yo menm, tankou Adam te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 8:1">Os 8:1</ref></char></note>kase transgresyon akò a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:7">La, yo pa t fidèl anvè Mwen.<verse eid="HOS 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 6:8"/>Galaad se yon vil ki plen ak malfektè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:8">plen ak tach san.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:11">Os 12:11</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:2">Os 4:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 6:9"/>Epi tankou bandi k ap tann yon moun;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:9">konsa, yon twoup prèt asasine moun</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:9">sou wout pou rive Sichem nan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:9">Se gwo krim y ap fè.<verse eid="HOS 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 6:10"/>Nan lakay Israël, Mwen te wè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:30">Jr 5:30</ref>,<ref loc="JER 5:31">31</ref></char></note> move bagay.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:10">Gen pwostitisyon nan Éphraïm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:10">Israël souye pwòp tèt li.<verse eid="HOS 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 6:11"/>Ou menm tou, O Juda!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:11">Gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:33">Jr 51:33</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:7">So 2:7</ref></char></note>rekòlt ki deja apwente pou ou menm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:11">lè Mwen retabli byennèt pèp Mwen an.<verse eid="HOS 6:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HOS 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 7:1"/>Lè M <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:13">Éz 24:13</ref> </char></note>ta geri blesi Israël,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:1">inikite a Éphraïm nan vin dekouvri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:1">ak mechanste a Samarie a tou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:1">paske yo aji nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:2">Os 4:2</ref></char></note>manti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:1">Vòlè a antre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:1">bandi yo atake pa deyò.<verse eid="HOS 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 7:2"/>Yo pa menm reflechi nan kè yo ke Mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:2">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 25:7">Sòm 25:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sonje tout mechanste yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:2">Alò, zak yo ap antoure yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:2">yo devan figi Mwen.<verse eid="HOS 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 7:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:32">Wo 1:32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ak mechanste yo, yo fè kè wa a kontan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:3">epi prens yo, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:2">Os 4:2</ref> </char></note>manti yo.<verse eid="HOS 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 7:4"/>Yo tout se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:2">Jr 9:2</ref></char></note>adiltè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:4">yo tankou yon fou la</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:4">ke bos boulanje sispann chofe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:4">depi nan lè l ap petri Pat farin nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:4">jis rive lè pan an fin leve.<verse eid="HOS 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 7:5"/>Nan jou a wa nou an, prens yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:5">te fè tèt yo malad ak chalè diven an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:5">Li te lonje men li ak mokè yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:1">És 28:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 28:7">7</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 7:6"/>Paske kè yo vin tankou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 21:9">Sòm 21:9</ref></char></note>fou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:6">pandan y ap kouche tan moun.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:6">Fachez yo fè gwo touf lafimen tout lannwit.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:6">Nan maten, li brile tankou yon gwo flanm dife.<verse eid="HOS 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 7:7"/>Yo tout cho tankou yon fou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:7">Yo manje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:10">Os 13:10</ref></char></note>jij yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:7">Tout wa yo fin tonbe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:7">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 64:7">És 64:7</ref> </char>
    </note>Nanpwen youn pami yo ki rele M.<verse eid="HOS 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 7:8"/>Éphraïm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:35">Sòm 106:35</ref></char></note>mele li menm ak nasyon yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:8">Éphraïm se yon gato ki pa t vire.<verse eid="HOS 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 7:9"/>Etranje yo devore fòs li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:9">men li pa wè sa a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:9">Anplis, cheve blanch yo la sou li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:9">men li pa konnen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:7">És 1:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 7:10"/>Malgre sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 5:5">Os 5:5</ref> </char></note>ògèy Israël la fè temwaye kont li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:10">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:13">És 9:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>men yo pa retounen kote SENYÈ a, Bondye yo a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:10">Ni yo pa chache Li, malgre tout sa.<verse eid="HOS 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 7:11"/>Konsa, Éphraïm te vin tankou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:11">yon toutrèl egare, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:6">Os 4:6</ref>,<ref loc="HOS 4:11">11</ref>,<ref loc="HOS 4:14">14</ref></char></note>san bon sans.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:11">Yo rele vè Egypte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:11">Yo ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 5:13">Os 5:13</ref> </char></note>Assyrie.<verse eid="HOS 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 7:12"/>Lè yo ale, Mwen va ouvri pèlen Mwen sou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:12">Mwen va desann yo tankou zwazo syèl yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:12">Mwen va bay yo chatiman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:12">jan kongregasyon yo a te tande a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:13">Éz 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:14-39">Lev 26:14-39</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 7:13"/>Malè a yo menm!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:13">Paske yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:10">Jr 14:10</ref> </char></note>gaye kite Mwen!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:13">Destriksyon pou yo menm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:13">paske yo te fè rebèl kont Mwen!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:13">Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:9">Jr 51:9</ref></char></note>ta rachte yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:13">men yo fè manti kont Mwen.<verse eid="HOS 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 7:14"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 35:9-11">Job 35:9-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo pa t kriye a Mwen menm avèk kè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:14">men yo rele fò sou kabann yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:14">Yo rasanble tèt yo pou sereyal ak diven nèf.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:14">Men yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:16">Os 13:16</ref> </char></note>vire kite Mwen.<verse eid="HOS 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 7:15"/>Malgre se Mwen ki enstwi ponyèt yo pou yo ta vin fò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:15">malgre sa, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 1:9">Na 1:9</ref> </char></note>fè konplo pou mal kont Mwen.<verse eid="HOS 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 7:16"/>Yo vire, men pa a Sila ki anwo a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:16">Yo tankou yon banza k ap twonpe moun.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:16">Prens yo va tonbe devan nepe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:16">akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 12:3">Sòm 12:3</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 12:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:32">Éz 23:32</ref></char></note>ensolans a lang yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:16">Sa va fèt pou yo ka vin pase nan rizib nan peyi Egypte.<verse eid="HOS 7:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HOS 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 8:1"/>Mete twonpèt la sou lèv ou yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:1">Yon bagay tankou malfini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:1">vini kont lakay SENYÈ a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:1">akoz yo te transgrese akò Mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:1">e fè rebèl kont lalwa Mwen an.<verse eid="HOS 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 8:2"/>Yo va rele a Mwen menm:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:2">‘Bondye mwen an, nou menm—Israël—Nou konnen Ou.’<verse eid="HOS 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 8:3"/>Israël te rejte sa ki bon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:3">lènmi an va kouri dèyè l.<verse eid="HOS 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 8:4"/>Yo vin plase wa yo, men pa selon Mwen menm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:4">Yo te chwazi prens yo, men pa selon Mwen menm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:4">Ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:8">Os 2:8</ref></char></note>ajan ak lò pa yo, yo te fè zidòl pou kont yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:4">jis pou yo ta ka koupe retire nèt.<verse eid="HOS 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 8:5"/>Kite Samarie jete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:5">Os 10:5</ref></char></note>jenn bèf li deyò!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:5">Kòlè Mwen ap brile kont yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:5">Pou konbyen de tan yo va rete</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:5">san kapasite pou pirifye?<verse eid="HOS 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 8:6"/>Paske, sa sòti menm an Israël!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:6">Se yon ouvriye ki fè l. Li pa Bondye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:6">Anverite, jenn bèf Samarie a va kraze an mòso.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:2">Os 13:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 8:7"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 22:8">Pwov 22:8</ref></char></note>yo simen van,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:7">e yo rekòlte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:15">És 66:15</ref> </char></note>toubiyon.<verse eid="HOS 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 8:8"/>Israël vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:6">II Wa 17:6</ref></char></note>vale nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:8">Koulye a, se pami nasyon yo ye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:8">tankou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:28">Jr 22:28</ref> </char></note>veso ki pa bay plezi a okenn moun.<verse eid="HOS 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 8:9"/>Paske yo te monte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 7:11">Os 7:11</ref> </char></note>Assyrie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:9">kon yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:24">Jr 2:24</ref></char></note>bourik mawon pou kont li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:9">Éphraïm te achte moun pou l ta renmen ak yo.<verse eid="HOS 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 8:10"/>Malgre yo vann tèt yo pami nasyon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:10">se koulye a, Mwen va ranmase yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:10">Yo kòmanse vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 42:2">Jr 42:2</ref></char></note>febli akoz presyon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:10">a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:8">És 10:8</ref> </char></note>wa de sa yo ak pwisans.<verse eid="HOS 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 8:11"/>Akoz Éphraïm te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:1">Os 10:1</ref></char></note>miltipliye lotèl pou fè peche yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:11">Yo te devni lotèl pou li pou peche yo.<verse eid="HOS 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 8:12"/>Malgre sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:6">Det 4:6</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 4:8">8</ref> </char></note>Mwen te ekri pou li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:12">règleman san fen de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:6">Os 4:6</ref></char></note>Lalwa Mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:12">men yo gade yo tankou yon bagay ki dwòl.<verse eid="HOS 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 8:13"/>Pou sakrifis ofrann Mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:13">yo fè sakrifis vyann, e yo manje l.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:13">SENYÈ a pa pran okenn plezi nan yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:13">Konsa, Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:10">Jr 14:10</ref> </char></note>sonje inikite yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:13">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:9">Os 4:9</ref></char></note>pini peche yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:13">Yo va retounen an Egypte.<verse eid="HOS 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 8:14"/>Paske Israël te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:18">Det 32:18</ref> </char></note>bliye Kreyatè li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:14">Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:9">És 9:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 9:10">10</ref></char></note>bati palè yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:14">Konsa, Juda te miltipliye vil fòtifye yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:14">men Mwen va voye dife sou vil li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:14">e konsa, li va devore gwo palè li yo.<verse eid="HOS 8:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HOS 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 9:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 22:12">És 22:12</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 22:13">13</ref> </char>
    </note>Pa rejwi, O Israël, ak lajwa kon nasyon yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:1">Paske ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:12">Os 4:12</ref></char></note>fè pwostitisyon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:1">Ou te abandone Bondye ou a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:1">Ou te renmen salè kòb ki konn</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:1">ranmase sou nenpòt glasi vannen.<verse eid="HOS 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 9:2"/>Glasi vannen a ak pèz diven an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:9">Os 2:9</ref></char></note>p ap nouri yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:2">e diven nèf la va fè yo vin twonpe.<verse eid="HOS 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 9:3"/>Yo p ap rete nan peyi SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:3">men Éphraïm va retounen an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 7:16">Os 7:16</ref></char></note>Égypte,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:3">e yo va manje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:13">Éz 4:13</ref> </char></note>sa ki pa pwòp an Assyrie.<verse eid="HOS 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 9:4"/>Yo p ap vide ofrann bwason diven a SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:4">Ni yo p ap fè L plezi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:4">Sakrifis yo va tankou pen moun ki fè dèy pou mò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:4">Tout moun ki manje ladan va vin souye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:4">paske pen pa yo va sèlman pou plen vant yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:4">Li p ap antre lakay SENYÈ a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:20">Jr 6:20</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:13">Ag 2:13</ref>,<ref loc="HAG 2:14">14</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 9:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:3">És 10:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kisa ou va fè nan jou fèt apwente a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:5">ak nan jou a fèt SENYÈ a?<verse eid="HOS 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 9:6"/>Paske, gade byen, lè yo pran flit devan destriksyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:6">Égypte va ranmase yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:6">Moph va antere yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:6">Se machacha k ap vin pran trezò ajan yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:6">Se bwa pikan k ap fè tant yo.<verse eid="HOS 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 9:7"/>Jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:3">És 10:3</ref> </char></note>pinisyon yo gen tan rive.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:7">Jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:8">És 34:8</ref></char></note>jijman yo gen tan rive.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:7">Israël va konsidere Pwofèt la kon yon moun fou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:7">moun ki gen gwo limyè a kon plen ak foli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:7">akoz inikite ou yo tèlman vin anpil,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:7">e akoz rayisman ou yo vin tèlman gran.<verse eid="HOS 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 9:8"/>Yon pwofèt veye sou Éphraïm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:8">avèk Bondye mwen an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:8">Yon pèlen moun pou kapte se nan tout chemen li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:8">e se sèl mepriz li twouve lakay Bondye li a.<verse eid="HOS 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 9:9"/>Yo antre tèt yo byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 31:6">És 31:6</ref></char></note>fon nan koripsyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:9">tankou nan jou a Guibea yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:9">Li va sonje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 7:2">Os 7:2</ref> </char></note>inikite yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:9">Li va pini peche yo.<verse eid="HOS 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 9:10"/>Mwen te twouve Israël</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:1">Mi 7:1</ref> </char></note>rezen yo nan dezè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">Mwen te wè papa zansèt nou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:2">Jr 24:2</ref></char></note>premye fwi sou pye fig nan premye sezon li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">Men yo te rive kote Baal-Peor;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">yo te konsakre tèt yo a gwo wont,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">e yo te vin abominab menm jan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">ak sila ke yo te renmen a.<verse eid="HOS 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 9:11"/>Pou Éphraïm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:7">Os 4:7</ref></char></note>glwa yo va vole ale kon zwazo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:11">P ap gen ni nesans, ni ansent, ni konsepsyon.<verse eid="HOS 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 9:12"/>Malgre yo leve pwòp pitit yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:12">Mwen va prive yo de yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:12">jiskaske pa gen yon moun ki rete.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:12">Wi, anverite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:17">Det 31:17</ref> </char></note>malè a yo menm, lè Mwen kite yo!<verse eid="HOS 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 9:13"/>Mwen wè Éphraïm, jan Mwen te wè Tyr la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:13">plante nan yon bèl chan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:13">men Éphraïm va fè parèt ak pitit li yo pou gran masak la.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:1-21">Éz 26:1-21</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 9:14"/>Bay yo!—O SENYÈ! Kisa Ou va bay yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:14">Bay yo yon ti vant foskouch <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:11">Os 9:11</ref> </char></note> ak tete sèch.<verse eid="HOS 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 9:15"/>Tout mechanste yo se nan Guilgal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:15">Anverite se la Mwen te rayi yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:15">Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:9">Os 4:9</ref></char></note>mechanste a zak yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:15">Mwen va chase yo sòti lakay Mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:15">Mwen p ap renmen yo ankò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:15">tout prens yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:23">És 1:23</ref> </char></note>rebèl.<verse eid="HOS 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 9:16"/>Éphraïm vin frape.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:16">Rasin yo vin sèch.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:16">Yo p ap bay fwi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:16">Menm si yo ka fè pitit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:16">Mwen va touye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 8:7">Os 8:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 24:21">Éz 24:21</ref> </char></note>fwi byeneme a vant yo a.<verse eid="HOS 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 9:17"/>Bondye mwen an va jete yo deyò</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:17">akoz yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:10">Os 4:10</ref></char></note>pa t koute Li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:17">epi yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 7:13">Os 7:13</ref> </char></note>vin vagabon pami nasyon yo.<verse eid="HOS 9:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HOS 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 10:1"/>Israël se yon pye rezen byen fètil;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:1">li pwodwi fwi pou pwòp tèt li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:1">Selon kantite fwi li te genyen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:1">li te miltipliye lotèl li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:1">Selon bonte a peyi yo a, yo te fè pilye sakre.<verse eid="HOS 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 10:2"/>Kè yo vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:28">Jr 2:28</ref> </char></note>divize.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:2">Koulye a, yo gen pou pote pwòp <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:23">I Wa 14:23</ref></char></note>koupabilite yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:2">SENYÈ a va kraze lotèl yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:2">Li va detwi pilye sakre yo.<verse eid="HOS 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 10:3"/>Anverite, koulye a yo va di: “Nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 12:4">Sòm 12:4</ref></char></note>pa gen wa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:3">paske nou pa krent SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:3">Epi wa a, se kisa li ka fè pou nou?”<verse eid="HOS 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 10:4"/>Se sèlman pawòl ke yo pale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:4">ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:13-19">Éz 17:13-19</ref> </char></note>fo sèman pou fè akò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:4">Donk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:16">Det 31:16</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 31:17">17</ref></char></note>jijman yo pete leve tankou zèb</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:4">k ap anpwazone nan tras chan yo.<verse eid="HOS 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 10:5"/>Pèp Samarie yo va gen lakrent</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:5">akoz jenn bèf Beth-Aven nan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:5">Anverite, pèp li a va fè lamantasyon pou li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:5">ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:5">II Wa 23:5</ref></char></note>prèt zidòl yo k ap kriye pou li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:5">pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:11">Os 9:11</ref> </char></note>glwa li, akoz sa fin ale kite li nèt.<verse eid="HOS 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 10:6"/>Sa va pote ale osi an Assyrie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:6">pou fè omaj a Wa Jareb.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:6">Éphraïm va resevwa lawont,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:6">e Israël va vin wont de pwòp konsèy li.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:7">Os 4:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:3">És 30:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 10:7"/>Pou Samarie, wa li a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:11">Os 13:11</ref></char></note> vin peri</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:7">tankou ti bout bwa Ki parèt sou fas dlo.<verse eid="HOS 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 10:8"/>Anplis, wo plas Aven yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:8">peche Israël la, va vin detwi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:8">Pikan ak raje va grandi sou lotèl yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:8">Yo va di a mòn yo: “Kouvri nou!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:8">E a kolin yo: “Vin tonbe sou nou.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28-30">I Wa 12:28-30</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:19">És 2:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 10:9"/>O Israël! Depi nan jou a Guibea yo, ou te peche.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:9">Se la yo te kanpe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:9">Ni batay kont fis inikite yo pa t kite yo nan Guibea.<verse eid="HOS 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 10:10"/>Lè se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:13">Éz 5:13</ref> </char></note>volonte Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:10">Mwen va bay yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:9">Os 4:9</ref></char></note>chatiman.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:10">Konsa, pèp yo va vin rasanble kont yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:10">lè yo mare nèt nan koupabilite doub yo.<verse eid="HOS 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 10:11"/>Éphraïm se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:11">Jr 50:11</ref> </char></note>gazèl bèf byen antrene</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:11">ki renmen foule grenn nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:11">men Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 28:14">Jr 28:14</ref></char></note>pase jouk la</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:11">sou bèl kou li a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:11">Mwen va mete yon kavalye sou Éphraïm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:11">Juda va raboure.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:11">Jacob va repase pou kraze bol tè a.<verse eid="HOS 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 10:12"/>Simen a nou menm anvè ladwati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:12">rekòlte selon ladousè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:12">Fann tè ki poze ou a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:12">se lè pou chache SENYÈ a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:12">jis lè Li vin vide ladwati sou nou.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:18">Pwov 11:18</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 12:6">Os 12:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 10:13"/>Nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:8">Job 4:8</ref> </char></note>raboure mechanste;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:13">nou te rekòlte lenjistis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:13">Nou te manje fwi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:2">Os 4:2</ref></char></note>manti a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:13">akoz nou te mete konfyans nou nan chemen nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:13">nan fòs kantite gèrye pisan nou yo.<verse eid="HOS 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 10:14"/>Akoz sa, yon gran gè va leve pami pèp nou an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:14">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 17:3">És 17:3</ref></char></note>tout fòterès nou yo va detwi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:14">tankou Schalman te detwi Beth-Arbel</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:14">nan jou batay la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:14">lè manman an te kraze an mòso ak pitit li yo.<verse eid="HOS 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 10:15"/>Konsa li va ye pou nou menm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:15">nan Bétel akoz gwo Mechanste nou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:15">Bonè nan maten, wa Israël la va vin detwi nèt.<verse eid="HOS 10:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HOS 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 11:1"/>Lè Israël te yon timoun, Mwen te renmen l;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:1">epi soti nan Égypte, Mwen te rele fis mwen an.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:15">Os 2:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 11:2"/>Plis pwofèt yo te rele yo, plis yo te kouri kite yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:2">Yo te kontinye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:13">Os 2:13</ref></char></note>fè sakrifis bay Baal yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:2">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:7">És 65:7</ref> </char></note>brile lansan bay zidòl yo.<verse eid="HOS 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 11:3"/>Malgre sa, se te Mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:3">ki te montre Éphraïm jan pou l mache.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:3">Nan bra M, Mwen te pran yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:3">men yo pa t konnen ke Mwen te geri yo.<verse eid="HOS 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 11:4"/>Mwen te mennen yo ak kòd a yon nonm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:4">ak lyann lanmou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:4">Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:13">Lev 26:13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 16:32">Egz 16:32</ref></char></note>Mwen te vini pou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:4">kon sila ki retire jouk la sòti nan kou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:4">Mwen te bese mete manje devan yo.<verse eid="HOS 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 11:5"/>Yo p ap retounen nan peyi Égypte,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:5">men Wa Assyrie a va vin wa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:5">akoz yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 7:16">Os 7:16</ref> </char></note>refize retounen kote Mwen.<verse eid="HOS 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 11:6"/>Nepe va tonbe kont vil yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:6">pou kraze pòtay ak fè fòje yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:6">e li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 2:9">Lam 2:9</ref></char></note>fè tout plan yo disparèt.<verse eid="HOS 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 11:7"/>Pèp Mwen an fè desizyon nèt pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:6">Jr 3:6</ref>,<ref loc="JER 3:7">7</ref> </char></note>vire kite Mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:7">Malgre yo rele yo vè Sila ki Pi Wo a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:7">anverite, yo p ap egzalte.<verse eid="HOS 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 11:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 6:4">Os 6:4</ref> </char>
    </note>Kòman Mwen ta kapab lage ou, O Éphraïm?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">Kòman Mwen ta kapab kite ou ale, O Israël?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">Kòman Mwen ta kapab fè ou tankou Adma?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">Kòman Mwen ta kapab aji avèk ou tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:8">Jen 14:8</ref></char></note>Tseboïm?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">Kè M vire nèt anndan M;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">konpasyon Mwen vin anflame.<verse eid="HOS 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 11:9"/>Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:17">Det 13:17</ref> </char></note>p ap egzekite chalè kòlè Mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:9">Mwen p ap detwi Éphraïm ankò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:9">Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:19">Nonb 23:19</ref></char></note>se Bondye Mwen ye, Mwen pa lòm;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:9">Sila Ki Sen nan mitan nou an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:9">e Mwen p ap antre nan kòlè.<verse eid="HOS 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 11:10"/>Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 3:5">Os 3:5</ref></char></note>mache dèyè SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:10">Li va gwonde kon yon lyon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:10">Anverite, Li va gwonde, e fis li yo va vini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:10">ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:2">És 66:2</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 66:5">5</ref> </char></note>tranble soti nan lwès.<verse eid="HOS 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 11:11"/>Yo va vini tranblan tankou zwazo, soti an Égypte,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:11">e kon toutrèl soti nan peyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:11">És 11:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:25">Éz 28:25</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 28:26">26</ref></char></note>Assyrie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:11">epi Mwen va plase yo nan kay pa yo, deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="HOS 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 11:12"/>Éphraïm antoure Mwen ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:2">Os 4:2</ref></char></note>manti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:12">e lakay Israël ak desepsyon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:12">Men anplis, Juda toujou egare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:12">kont Bondye, li pa fidèl a Sila Ki Sen an.<verse eid="HOS 11:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HOS 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 12:1"/>Éphraïm manje sou van,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:1">e kouri dèyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:6">Jen 41:6</ref></char></note>van lès la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:1">Li kontinye ap ogmante nan manti ak vyolans.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:1">Anplis, li fè yon akò ak Assyrie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:1">e lwil vin pote an Égypte.<verse eid="HOS 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 12:2"/>Plis toujou, SENYÈ a gen yon kont ak Juda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:2">e Li va pini Jacob <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:1">Os 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 7:2">Os 7:2</ref></char></note>selon chemen li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:2">Li va rekonpanse li selon zak li yo.<verse eid="HOS 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 12:3"/>Nan vant manman, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:26">Jen 25:26</ref></char></note>kenbe frè l pa talon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:3">epi lè l fin grandi, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Jen 32:28</ref> </char></note>lite ak Bondye.<verse eid="HOS 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 12:4"/>Wi, li te lite ak zanj lan, e li te enpoze l;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:4">li te kriye e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:26">Jen 32:26</ref></char></note>chache favè li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:4">Li te jwenn Li Béthel, e se la, Li te pale ak nou.<verse eid="HOS 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 12:5"/>Menm SENYÈ a, Bondye dèzame yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:5">SENYÈ a se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:15">Egz 3:15</ref> </char></note>non Li!<verse eid="HOS 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 12:6"/>Pou sa, retounen kote Bondye ou a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:6">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 6:1-3">Os 6:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:8">Mi 6:8</ref> </char>
    </note>Swiv ladousè ak lajistis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:6">e tann Bondye ou a tout tan.<verse eid="HOS 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 12:7"/>Men yon machann, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:1">Pwov 11:1</ref></char></note>fo balans lan nan men l.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:7">Li renmen twonpe moun.<verse eid="HOS 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 12:8"/>Éphraïm te di: “Anverite, mwen gen tan vin rich.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:8">Mwen te twouve richès mwen pou kont mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:8">Nan tout zèv mwen yo, yo p ap dekouvri</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:8">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 4:8">Os 4:8</ref> </char>
    </note>okenn inikite, ki ta peche.”<verse eid="HOS 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 12:9"/>Men Mwen menm, SENYÈ Bondye ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:9">depi nan peyi Égypte la, va fè ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:42">Lev 23:42</ref> </char></note>viv nan tant ankò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:9">tankou nan jou fèt deziye yo.<verse eid="HOS 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 12:10"/>Anplis, Mwen te pale ak pwofèt yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:10">e mwen te miltipliye vizyon yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:10">epi selon ministè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:13">II Wa 17:13</ref></char></note>pwofèt yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:10">mwen te sèvi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:2">Éz 17:2</ref> </char></note>parabòl.<verse eid="HOS 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 12:11"/>Èske gen inikite nan Galaad?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:11">Anverite, yo tout san valè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:11">Nan Guilgal, yo fè sakrifis towo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:11">wi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 8:11">Os 8:11</ref> </char></note>lotèl pa yo tankou pil wòch nan mitan chan.<verse eid="HOS 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 12:12"/>Alò, Jacob te sove ale nan peyi Aram,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:12">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 28:5">Jen 28:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 29:20">Jen 29:20</ref></char>
    </note>Israël te travay pou resevwa yon madanm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:12">Pou yon madanm, li te fè gadyen mouton.<verse eid="HOS 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 12:13"/>Epi pa yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:19-22">Egz 14:19-22</ref></char></note>pwofèt, SENYÈ a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:13">te mennen Israël sòti an Égypte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:13">Pa yon pwofèt, li te vin prezève.<verse eid="HOS 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 12:14"/>Éphraïm te pwovoke gwo kòlè amè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:14">Akoz sa, Senyè li va kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:10-13">Éz 18:10-13</ref></char></note>san li koule sou li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:14">e fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:18">Dan 11:18</ref> </char></note>repwòch li tounen sou li.<verse eid="HOS 12:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HOS 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 13:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 29:21">Job 29:21</ref>,<ref loc="JOB 29:22">22</ref></char>
    </note>Lè Éphraïm te pale, te gen tranbleman.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:1">Li te leve tèt li wo an Israël;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:1">men ak Baal, li te fè mal, e li te mouri.<verse eid="HOS 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 13:2"/>Epi koulye a, yo peche plis toujou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:2">e yo fè pou tèt yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 46:6">És 46:6</ref></char></note>imaj fonn an ajan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:2">menm zidòl yo selon jan yo konprann.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:2">Yo tout se zèv a mèt ouvriye yo ye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:2">Yo di a yo menm: “Yo ofri sakrifis imen yo, e bo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 8:5">Os 8:5</ref>,<ref loc="HOS 8:6">6</ref> </char></note>ti bèf yo!”<verse eid="HOS 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 13:3"/>Akoz sa, yo va tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:4">Os 6:4</ref></char></note>nwaj nan maten an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:3">ak lawouze k ap disparèt bonè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:3">tankou pay ke van pote ale soti nan glasi vannen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:3">e tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:2">Sòm 68:2</ref> </char></note>Lafimen soti nan chemine.<verse eid="HOS 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 13:4"/>Malgre sa, Mwen se SENYÈ, Bondye ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:4">depi nan peyi Égypte la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:4">epi ou pa pou konnen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:3">Egz 20:3</ref></char></note>okenn dye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:4">sof ke Mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:4">paske nanpwen sovè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:11">És 43:11</ref> </char></note>sof ke Mwen.<verse eid="HOS 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 13:5"/>Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:7">Det 2:7</ref></char></note>pran swen ou nan dezè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:5">nan peyi sechrès la.<verse eid="HOS 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 13:6"/>Lè yo te vin jwenn patiraj yo, yo te vin satisfè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:6">yo te vin satisfè e kè yo te vin ògeye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:6">Konsa, yo te bliye Mwen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 7:14">Os 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:13">Os 2:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="HOS 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 13:7"/>Akoz sa, Mwen va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 3:10">Lam 3:10</ref> </char></note>tankou yon lyon anvè yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:7">Kon yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:6">Jr 5:6</ref></char></note>leyopa, Mwen va kouche</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:7">an kachèt bò chemen an.<verse eid="HOS 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 13:8"/>Mwen va rankontre yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:8">II Sam 17:8</ref> </char></note>kon yon lous</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:8">ki fenk fin pèdi pitit li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:8">e mwen va chire lestomak yo nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:8">Sou plas, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:22">Sòm 50:22</ref></char></note>devore yo tankou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:8">yon manman lyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:8">jan yon bèt sovaj ta chire yo.<verse eid="HOS 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 13:9"/>Se destriksyon pa w, O Israël!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:9">Akoz ou kont Mwen, kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:26">Det 33:26</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 33:29">29</ref> </char></note>sekou ou.<verse eid="HOS 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 13:10"/>Kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:4">II Wa 17:4</ref> </char></note>wa ou a koulye a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:10">pou li ta ka sove ou nan tout vil ou yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:10">Ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">I Sam 8:5</ref>,<ref loc="1SA 8:6">6</ref></char></note>jij ke ou te mande yo: “Ban mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:10">yon wa ak prens yo”?<verse eid="HOS 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 13:11"/>Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:7">I Sam 8:7</ref></char></note>te bay ou yon wa nan kòlè Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:11">e Mwen te fè l soti nan kòlè Mwen.<verse eid="HOS 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 13:12"/>Inikite a Éphraïm vin ogmante nèt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:12">peche li vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:34">Det 32:34</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 32:35">35</ref> </char></note>mete nan depo.<verse eid="HOS 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 13:13"/>Doulè a yon fanm k ap pouse pitit va vini sou li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:13">se pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:6">Det 32:6</ref></char></note> yon fis ki saj, k ap rete nan vant</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:13">ki ouvri e k ap tann li soti a.<verse eid="HOS 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 13:14"/>Mwen va rachte yo soti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:14">anba pouvwa a Sejou mò yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:14">mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 49:15">Sòm 49:15</ref> </char></note>rachte yo soti anba lanmò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:14">O lanmò! Kote pikan ou yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:14">O Sejou mò yo! Kote destriksyon ou an?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:14">Repantans va vin kache devan zye M.<verse eid="HOS 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 13:15"/>Malgre li pote fwi pami frè li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:6">Jen 41:6</ref> </char></note>van nan lès va vini;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">van SENYÈ a k ap monte soti nan dezè a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">Sous dlo li va vin sèch,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">e fontèn dlo li va seche.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:5">Jr 20:5</ref></char></note> piyaje trezò tout bagay ki gen valè.<verse eid="HOS 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 13:16"/>Samarie va pote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:2">Os 10:2</ref></char></note>koupabilite li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:16">paske li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 7:14">Os 7:14</ref></char></note>fè rebèl kont Bondye li a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:16">Yo va tonbe pa nepe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:16">Timoun piti yo va vin kraze an mòso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:16">epi fanm ansent yo va vin dechire nèt.<verse eid="HOS 13:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="HOS 14"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 14:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 6:1">Os 6:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Retounen, O Israël, kote SENYÈ, Bondye ou a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:1">Paske ou te glise tonbe akoz inikite ou.<verse eid="HOS 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 14:2"/>Pran avèk ou menm pawòl yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:2">pou retounen kote SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:2">Di Li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:18">Mi 7:18</ref>,<ref loc="MIC 7:19">19</ref></char></note>“Retire tout inikite nou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:2">e resevwa nou ak gras Ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:2">pou nou ka bay ofrann bèf yo kon ve a lèv nou.<verse eid="HOS 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 14:3"/>Assyrie p ap sove nou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:3">Nou p ap monte sou cheval;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:3">ni nou p ap di ankò a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:3">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 8:6">Os 8:6</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:12">Os 4:12</ref></char>
    </note>zèv men nou yo: “Ou se dye nou.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:3">Paske nan Ou, òfelen an twouve mizerikòd.”<verse eid="HOS 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 14:4"/>“Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:18">És 57:18</ref> </char></note>geri enfidelite yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:4">Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 3:17">So 3:17</ref></char></note>renmen yo an abondans,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:4">paske kòlè Mwen fin vire lwen yo.<verse eid="HOS 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 14:5"/>Mwen va tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 19:12">Pwov 19:12</ref></char></note>Lawouze pou Israël;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:5">li va fleri kon flè lis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:5">e li va anrasine tankou pye sèd a Liban yo.<verse eid="HOS 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 14:6"/>Boujon li yo va vin pete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:6">e bèlte li va tankou pye doliv etranje a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:6">Li va santi bon kon bèl odè Liban an.<verse eid="HOS 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 14:7"/>Moun yo va rete nan lonbraj li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:7">Yo va reprann fòs tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:21">Os 2:21</ref>,<ref loc="HOS 2:22">22</ref></char></note>sereyal ki jwenn lapli;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:7">yo va fleri tankou pye rezen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:7">Y ap fè bon odè tankou diven Liban an.<verse eid="HOS 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 14:8"/>O Éphraïm! Kisa M gen pou fè ankò ak zidòl?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:8">Se Mwen menm ki okipe l;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:8">Mwen tankou yon pye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:19">És 41:19</ref></char></note>siprè byen vèt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:8">nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:23">Éz 17:23</ref> </char></note>Mwen, tout fwi ou sòti.”<verse eid="HOS 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 14:9"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 107:43">Sòm 107:43</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nenpòt moun ki saj, kite li konprann bagay sa yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:9">Sila ki pridan an, kite li konnen yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:9">Paske, chemen a SENYÈ yo dwat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:9">e moun ladwati a va mache ladan yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:9">men transgresè yo va glise tonbe nan yo.<verse eid="HOS 14:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 14"/>
</usx>
